# Document filenames that may appear in this repository and in its commit messages.
#
# docmd is developed against corpora of real business documents. Those documents are not in
# this repository and must not be identifiable from it: their filenames carry the customer, the
# project, and sometimes the deal. A defect report once cited one by name and reached the
# default branch, and removing it meant rewriting published history.
#
# Anything ending .docx/.docm/.dotx/.dotm that is not listed here fails the build. If you need
# to refer to a real document, describe it instead: "a 1,000-paragraph design document".
#
# One name per line. Case-insensitive. Blank lines and # comments ignored.

# Fixtures and test artefacts this repository owns
sample.docx
report.docx
noise.docx
noisy.docx
real.docx
with-image.docx
absent.docx
big.docx

